                                        </li>
                
                                        <li>
                                            <span class="point-title">Confidentiality:</span>
                                            <ul>
                                                <li>
                                                    During the term of this Agreement, each party (the
                                                    "disclosing party") may communicate to the other party
                                                    (the "receiving party") information which it considers
                                                    to be confidential ("Confidential Information"). All
                                                    Confidential Information shall be specifically
                                                    designated as confidential. Such Confidential
